{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43392","headline":"又和大庆堂赐宴元璫有诗呈吴越王 · 吴越失姓名人","name":"又和大庆堂赐宴元璫有诗呈吴越王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃花下会亲贤，风远铜壶转露盘。\n蝶下粉墙梅乍折，蚁浮金斝酒难乾。\n云和缓奏泉声咽，珠箔低垂水影寒。\n狂简斐然吟咏足，却邀羣彦重吟看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越失姓名人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}